# Ovis plugin settings, read by scripts/plugin.ts before it starts the server.
# Deployed as a store symlink at
# ~/.config/herdr/plugins/config/devswha.ovis/env (modules/home/ovis.nix).
#
# OVIS_TELEMETRY=0 silences the only outbound traffic besides updates: install
# and update events, plus a daily "active" message naming which agent kinds run.
# Reversible by editing this line; DO_NOT_TRACK=1 would have the same effect.
OVIS_TELEMETRY=0

# No OVIS_TOKEN, and never add one here. /nix/store is world-readable (0444) and
# this repository is public, so a store symlink can never hold a credential —
# `git add` would publish it and every user on the machine could read it. The
# access model does not need one: the bind stays 127.0.0.1 and `tailscale serve`
# admits the node owner's devices by login. A token, if ever wanted, takes the
# sops.templates route at this same path with mode 0400 (doc/ovis.md).
